[{"client_msg_id":"6873a2bc-d79f-4603-85b7-5666d5bc8730","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"msys2のtmux","ts":"1621778572.020200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Wsb4"}]},{"client_msg_id":"45bcd6bf-e93d-430f-ab6b-56c5300cf7f6","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"環境はwin10です","ts":"1621778563.020100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Rr0IF"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a8d53482-4bf1-46e3-91b4-7edc55251611","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"あっちだとすぐ流れちゃいそうなのでこっちに移しておきます…\nもし原因わかる方いたら教えて下さい","ts":"1621778543.020000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"z1k"}]},{"type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","ts":"1621778508.019900","attachments":[{"color":"D0D0D0","fallback":"[May 23rd, 2021 8:35 PM] dotmapu: alacrittyからtmux attachするとopen terminal failed: not a terminalとなってしまうのですが、、、\n困ったな","author_id":"U01D9BALEKU","author_name":"KosukeMizuno","author_subname":"KosukeMizuno","author_link":"https://vim-jp.slack.com/team/U01D9BALEKU","author_icon":"https://avatars.slack-edge.com/2020-10-25/1444669637702_3879d2ec21d7f1fee9ad_48.jpg","text":"alacrittyからtmux attachするとopen terminal failed: not a terminalとなってしまうのですが、、、\n困ったな","mrkdwn_in":["text"],"blocks":null,"footer":"Posted in #question","ts":1621769754.106600,"from_url":"https://vim-jp.slack.com/archives/CJMV3MSLR/p1621769754106600"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"/qaG"}]},{"type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","ts":"1621778494.019800","attachments":[{"color":"D0D0D0","fallback":"[May 23rd, 2021 8:33 PM] dotmapu: tmuxいれたら、minttyからは起動できるけどalacrittyからは起動できない、という状態になってしまった","author_id":"U01D9BALEKU","author_name":"KosukeMizuno","author_subname":"KosukeMizuno","author_link":"https://vim-jp.slack.com/team/U01D9BALEKU","author_icon":"https://avatars.slack-edge.com/2020-10-25/1444669637702_3879d2ec21d7f1fee9ad_48.jpg","text":"tmuxいれたら、minttyからは起動できるけどalacrittyからは起動できない、という状態になってしまった","mrkdwn_in":["text"],"blocks":null,"footer":"Posted in #question","ts":1621769606.106500,"from_url":"https://vim-jp.slack.com/archives/CJMV3MSLR/p1621769606106500"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"qui"}]},{"client_msg_id":"11ae8213-1f32-492b-9e0d-c28bf364c6f0","type":"message","user":"U01ATUT6PL3","text":"明示的に q を押す必要がアアル","ts":"1621760399.019400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"m9Ekp"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8a065f59-dd78-4932-8fd9-93c4f253ad1b","type":"message","user":"U01ATUT6PL3","text":"ただこれをすると「スクロールしていない状態から」選択を開始しても、選択を終了するときに入力可能モードには戻ってくれないですね","ts":"1621760395.019200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"+zA"}]},{"client_msg_id":"494047d4-834b-4d47-9add-b96fd871c5af","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"お、なるほど\nこっちは知らなかったから知見っぽい","ts":"1621760339.018500","edited":{"user":"U8996GYBF","ts":"1621760354.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"HEsBC"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c7fc810a-e76b-4218-b8cb-37f97c4dc16c","type":"message","user":"U01ATUT6PL3","text":"マウスの方もこれでできました！\n```\n# マウスを離してもコピーモードを終了しないようにする\nbind-key -T copy-mode-vi MouseDragEnd1Pane send-keys -X copy-pipe```","ts":"1621760321.018200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"0G=T8"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8744348e-e31c-410b-8509-4a0518d3873b","type":"message","user":"U01ATUT6PL3","text":"ありがとうございます！　キーボードの方はできました。マウスの方もがんばっていじればできると思います。ありがとうございました！","ts":"1621760084.018000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"n8Cw"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5a82ea54-d9b4-4935-9506-7a0823800bb0","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"```Command                                      vi              emacs\ncopy-end-of-line [\u0026lt;prefix\u0026gt;]                  D               C-k\ncopy-line [\u0026lt;prefix\u0026gt;]\ncopy-pipe [\u0026lt;command\u0026gt;] [\u0026lt;prefix\u0026gt;]\ncopy-pipe-no-clear [\u0026lt;command\u0026gt;] [\u0026lt;prefix\u0026gt;]\ncopy-pipe-and-cancel [\u0026lt;command\u0026gt;] [\u0026lt;prefix\u0026gt;]\ncopy-selection [\u0026lt;prefix\u0026gt;]\ncopy-selection-no-clear [\u0026lt;prefix\u0026gt;]\ncopy-selection-and-cancel [\u0026lt;prefix\u0026gt;]         Enter           M-w```\nこうなっていますね","ts":"1621751699.017400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ok9Y"}]},{"client_msg_id":"dc5ab18a-e13b-4768-8f41-36fbb0b033e4","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"デフォが `copy-pipe-and-cancel` だと思うんですけど、 `copy-pipe` があるのでこれじゃないかと思います","ts":"1621751582.017100","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"eyes","count":1,"users":["U022TD5GGKE"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"d2Z"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9426cd21-7f2d-4ff4-adfb-8fec2e10e42e","type":"message","user":"U01ATUT6PL3","text":"ご存じの方いたら教えてほしいのですが、 tmux で copy mode にいるところからある領域をコピーすると、copy mode から通常モードに戻ると思うのですが、これを戻らなくする方法はありますか？","ts":"1621751477.016600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"OGlH"}]},{"type":"message","user":"U022NU6THHB","text":"\u003c@U022NU6THHB\u003e has joined the channel","ts":"1621746341.015400","subtype":"channel_join","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null},{"type":"message","user":"U01B7FN0XBK","text":"\u003c@U01B7FN0XBK\u003e has joined the channel","ts":"1621736740.015200","subtype":"channel_join","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null}]
